  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1476/223/backpacked_banner-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"180\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/502/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/503/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/501/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/504/mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"需要 Framework\" width=\"222\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的網站\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 YouTube 頻道\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 Discord\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Backpacked 3.0.0 現已推出！</h1>\n<p><del style=\"text-align:center\">預計於 2026 年 1 月 21 日發布</del></p>\n<p>我會盡快更新此說明，抱歉 —— MrCrayfish</p>\n<p>🏘️&nbsp;<strong>社群擴充套件</strong><br><em>這些擴充套件增加了更多可供探索的背包！</em></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>Backpacked: Shells</strong> <em>by Beast135</em> <br>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-shells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-shells</a>)<br>新增兩個可解鎖的新背包：蝸牛貝殼與鹦鹉螺貝殼<br><br><strong>Backpacked: World of Color</strong> <em>by Beast135</em> <br>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-world-of-color)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked-world-of-color)</a><br>新增標準背包的染色變體</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod: Refurbished</strong> <em>by MrCrayfish</em> <br>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture</a>)<br>當與 Backpacked 模組同時安裝時，新增專屬的儲物櫃背包。</p>\n<p>🙋&zwj;♀️ <strong>需要支援？加入官方 Discord 伺服器：</strong></p>\n<p>留言區並不適合提供技術支援，請加入官方 Discord 伺服器。您可以在那裡獲得安裝與設定模組的協助、解決崩潰問題等！此外，您還能搶先獲取模組更新與開發動態的新聞。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/794/808/img.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"28\"></a></p>",
